WEBVTT

00:11.070 --> 00:12.820
Summer Break

00:11.070 --> 00:12.820
It's an "A"

00:11.070 --> 00:12.820
Life

00:11.070 --> 00:12.820
WeW

00:17.160 --> 00:18.700
Quiet, isn't it?

00:19.330 --> 00:21.360
It is a bit lonely,

00:21.360 --> 00:24.730
but it's also nice to walk around, without worry.

00:24.730 --> 00:25.750
Without worry?

00:26.520 --> 00:30.820
Normally, I have to be careful not to bump into a male student,

00:30.820 --> 00:33.130
so I'm extra attentive to how I walk...

00:33.740 --> 00:35.770
I'm used to it now, though!

00:35.770 --> 00:37.200
I see.

00:37.200 --> 00:40.810
And only on-duty teachers are here today.

00:40.810 --> 00:43.510
No one in the school but teachers...

00:43.510 --> 00:44.780
<i>Under these conditions,</i>

00:44.780 --> 00:47.480
<i>maybe I can finally invite him out for drinks!</i>

00:49.180 --> 00:50.820
<i>Mr. Takahashi,</i>

00:50.820 --> 00:53.100
<i>would you care to dine with me</i>

00:53.100 --> 00:54.240
<i>after school?</i>

00:54.240 --> 00:56.200
<i>Sure, sounds good.</i>

01:02.480 --> 01:05.960
<i>I think I'm a little tipsy.</i>

01:07.600 --> 01:09.290
<i>Ms. Satou...</i>

01:09.290 --> 01:10.170
<i>Yes?</i>

01:10.750 --> 01:13.800
<i>Tonight, I have no intention of going home.</i>

01:17.460 --> 01:20.750
<i>A toast... to your eyes.</i>

01:27.130 --> 01:28.120
Yeah, right...

01:28.120 --> 01:30.150
By the way, Ms. Satou?

01:30.150 --> 01:30.900
Yes?!

01:31.240 --> 01:32.840
Do you have plans tomorrow?

01:32.840 --> 01:33.320
Huh?

01:33.780 --> 01:35.290
Tomorrow?

01:35.290 --> 01:39.010
I'm free... I'm completely, totally free!

01:39.010 --> 01:40.540
Oh, that's right...

01:40.540 --> 01:43.760
I guess it would be tough for a succubus teacher.

01:43.760 --> 01:45.440
Forgive me for asking.

01:45.440 --> 01:47.340
Um, wait...

01:47.340 --> 01:49.430
What are you talking about?

01:49.430 --> 01:50.920
Patrol duty.

01:50.920 --> 01:52.840
At the summer festival.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.050
The summer festival?

01:57.550 --> 02:00.310
I want to talk...

02:00.310 --> 02:04.350
About your Wonderful Original

02:04.270 --> 02:04.310
Interviews with Monster Girls

02:10.320 --> 02:13.860
The class is astir

02:13.860 --> 02:17.490
I want to let myself go too,

02:18.740 --> 02:20.870
But I end up putting on a fake smile.

02:22.000 --> 02:28.750
Your eyes alone conveyed a competitive spirit

02:30.090 --> 02:33.550
Biting at your lip forcefully.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.880
You once said,

02:35.880 --> 02:39.600
"I wouldn't want to worry what someone thinks

02:39.600 --> 02:45.480
And end up hurting someone else in the process!"

02:46.310 --> 02:51.610
When the chime rings out, as the rain lifts up,

02:52.280 --> 02:56.660
We'll pass the boundaries of our school!

02:58.070 --> 03:03.080
Jumping through the puddles, light will scatter about

03:03.910 --> 03:08.380
Our smiles, and wishes will be so bright!

03:09.210 --> 03:11.380
I want to talk...

03:12.090 --> 03:16.090
About your Wonderful Original!

03:25.010 --> 03:28.060
The Demis' Summer Break

03:26.020 --> 03:28.060
Come on, hold still!

03:28.420 --> 03:29.810
Oh, yeah...

03:28.420 --> 03:31.540
We arrived at the rumored shrine grounds,

03:32.000 --> 03:37.020
Just then, an indescribable chill passed through the air.

03:34.060 --> 03:37.020
Jeez, you could at least tie your own obi.

03:38.130 --> 03:40.030
What was that?

03:40.030 --> 03:41.320
Hey, can we go ba—

03:41.840 --> 03:43.730
H-Himari!

03:43.730 --> 03:46.600
Hey... That's too tight...

03:46.600 --> 03:48.500
It's gonna squeeze my guts out!

03:48.500 --> 03:50.600
Oh. Sorry.

03:51.010 --> 03:54.430
Aw, and it was just getting good...

03:54.430 --> 03:56.780
Aren't you meeting your friends?

03:56.780 --> 03:57.880
There, done.

03:57.880 --> 04:01.070
If you keep watching that stuff, you'll be late.

04:01.070 --> 04:01.720
Hey...

04:02.410 --> 04:03.510
What?

04:03.510 --> 04:05.900
Aren't you going to wear a yukata?

04:06.620 --> 04:09.190
The others said they'll be in regular clothes.

04:09.190 --> 04:11.390
I don't want to be the only one in a yukata.

04:11.810 --> 04:12.810
Oh...

04:13.360 --> 04:15.210
Well, that's a little sad.

04:16.060 --> 04:18.950
G-Go on! You'll seriously be late!

04:18.950 --> 04:20.070
Whoa...

04:20.070 --> 04:22.650
Jeez, I get it already!

04:26.830 --> 04:26.870
Shibasaki City Hall

04:26.830 --> 04:26.870
Lost and Found

04:36.820 --> 04:37.590
Patrol?

04:38.000 --> 04:41.920
To keep students from misbehaving or causing problems.

04:41.920 --> 04:41.970
Fireworks Show

04:41.920 --> 04:41.970
Prevent Misconduct

04:41.920 --> 04:41.970
Don't.

04:41.920 --> 04:41.970
Ever.

04:42.410 --> 04:46.050
Each year, the teachers rotate for the job.

04:46.490 --> 04:49.720
Yeah, I could never handle that job.

04:50.220 --> 04:52.960
A place, even more crowded than most.

04:52.960 --> 04:54.850
And in a yukata, no less...

04:55.370 --> 04:57.350
There's no way!

05:02.370 --> 05:04.030
<i>What's the matter with you?</i>

05:08.310 --> 05:09.660
<i>Se... Se...</i>

05:09.660 --> 05:13.620
<i>Sexy!</i>

05:13.950 --> 05:14.790
It'd be

05:15.130 --> 05:15.960
just like

05:16.310 --> 05:17.250
terrorism...

05:17.250 --> 05:18.580
Aphrodisiac terrorism!

05:19.880 --> 05:23.330
Then again, to bring a yukata and not wear it would be...

05:22.660 --> 05:23.330
Good work.

05:23.330 --> 05:26.610
This is my chance to appeal to Mr. Takahashi!

05:23.430 --> 05:26.610
Man, I'm beat!

05:26.610 --> 05:30.740
But then my aphrodisiac effect would influence others, too!

05:26.610 --> 05:30.740
Why should a worker at city hall have to wear this thing?

05:30.740 --> 05:32.450
But this is such a rare chance!

05:30.740 --> 05:33.580
To save money, obviously.

05:32.450 --> 05:36.810
I want Mr. Takahashi to see me in a yukata!

05:33.580 --> 05:36.580
I'm at a festival, and I can't even bring a date.

05:36.580 --> 05:38.900
You aren't supposed to say that...

05:36.810 --> 05:38.900
But... But...

05:42.320 --> 05:44.310
Festival...

05:46.410 --> 05:49.030
Macchi and Yukki, you both look great in yukatas!

05:49.030 --> 05:52.260
You look good in yours, too. Right?

05:52.260 --> 05:53.270
Yes.

05:53.270 --> 05:55.000
You think so?

05:56.490 --> 05:58.560
Well, come on... Let's go!

05:59.070 --> 06:00.420
Sorry! Did you wait long?

06:00.920 --> 06:02.960
We just got here, also.

06:02.960 --> 06:04.800
Well, ready to go?

06:05.420 --> 06:08.620
By the way, your sister isn't with you?

06:08.620 --> 06:11.440
Until last year, she always came with me.

06:11.440 --> 06:15.210
Oh, the demis took her away, huh?

06:15.630 --> 06:16.930
Took her away?

06:17.520 --> 06:20.250
On the contrary, it's even more than I'd hoped for.

06:20.560 --> 06:21.480
Tasty

06:21.730 --> 06:21.770
Ring
Toss

06:22.330 --> 06:24.600
You know how my sister is.

06:24.600 --> 06:27.030
She gets more hyper than a little kid.

06:27.030 --> 06:30.360
To the point that being around her is embarrassing!

06:30.360 --> 06:33.380
And she wants everything she can get her hands on.

06:34.160 --> 06:37.460
Those really were tough times...

06:37.960 --> 06:41.040
You know, you sometimes look a lot older than you are.

06:41.420 --> 06:43.880
Hey, look at that! Candy cutting!

06:45.760 --> 06:47.880
This brings back memories!

06:47.880 --> 06:48.970
You're really excited.

06:49.910 --> 06:52.800
Aw, I broke it again...

06:52.800 --> 06:54.320
Mister! One more try!

06:54.320 --> 06:55.730
Talk about hyper.

06:55.730 --> 06:56.930
They're twins, all right.

06:57.860 --> 06:59.400
It's starting to get more crowded.

06:59.400 --> 07:00.770
Mr. Tetsu!

07:00.770 --> 07:01.310
Huh?

07:01.720 --> 07:02.730
Good evening.

07:02.730 --> 07:05.080
Hey. Together as usual, eh?

07:05.080 --> 07:07.040
What do you mean by "as usual"?

07:07.040 --> 07:08.110
Are you here alone?

07:09.980 --> 07:12.080
He's in a way sadder state than we are!

07:12.080 --> 07:15.290
I'm here on patrol. This is work.

07:15.610 --> 07:18.720
Then, we'll have extra fun for you, Mr. Tetsu.

07:18.720 --> 07:21.360
We're gonna coincidentally see some girls from class

07:21.360 --> 07:24.340
and have a fun, fulfilling time at the festival.

07:24.340 --> 07:25.960
Can you call that a coincidence?

07:26.500 --> 07:28.910
Don't get too crazy!

07:28.910 --> 07:31.120
I wonder if Hikari and the girls are here.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.760
Oops, sorry.

07:36.340 --> 07:37.510
There it is!

07:38.000 --> 07:40.960
That's gotta be hard work...

07:44.690 --> 07:47.080
Aw, it broke...

07:51.470 --> 07:54.490
Man! I thought I had it that time!

07:54.490 --> 07:56.040
Too bad.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.080
Once more!

07:57.080 --> 07:59.650
You don't give up easy, do ya?

07:59.650 --> 08:01.920
Hikari, this is your third try...

08:01.920 --> 08:05.310
Next time! Next time, I'm gonna get it!

08:05.310 --> 08:06.250
Oh?

08:06.250 --> 08:08.050
Well, I feel bad for ya.

08:08.050 --> 08:10.710
So if you lose this time, I'll give you a free play.

08:12.210 --> 08:13.890
Why is that so frustrating?

08:13.890 --> 08:15.130
I'm next.

08:16.340 --> 08:17.680
Here you go. Good luck.

08:22.380 --> 08:23.980
<i>She only let the hook touch the water.</i>

08:23.980 --> 08:26.060
<i>This girl is good!</i>

08:39.540 --> 08:42.060
I'll let you off the hook with this.

08:42.650 --> 08:44.040
You win.

08:44.410 --> 08:46.630
That was amazing, Yuki!

08:46.630 --> 08:49.210
Grandpa's good at these things.

08:49.210 --> 08:50.970
He taught me a lot.

08:50.970 --> 08:54.960
So his talent isn't limited to yelling, "Why, you!" Right?

08:54.960 --> 08:56.980
Uh, no, that isn't a talent.

08:56.980 --> 08:58.760
Oh! Mr. Katou!

08:58.760 --> 09:00.920
Looks like he's here on patrol.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.220
Then, I bet Mr. T's also here!

09:03.220 --> 09:05.000
Mr. Takahashi, too?

09:05.000 --> 09:07.650
Yes, he probably is.

09:08.560 --> 09:11.780
I'd like to show Mr. T how we look in our yukatas!

09:11.780 --> 09:13.280
Right, Macchi?

09:14.210 --> 09:16.030
Yeah... You're right.

09:20.370 --> 09:21.580
Hey, Mr. Takahashi!

09:22.560 --> 09:24.400
Oh, Ugaki.

09:24.400 --> 09:27.750
I was sent here to assist with security.

09:27.750 --> 09:30.770
In general, the Demi-human Division has little to do.

09:32.230 --> 09:34.260
By the way, how's Kurtz?

09:34.260 --> 09:36.340
He isn't with you this time?

09:36.340 --> 09:37.840
Oh, him...

09:39.250 --> 09:41.440
No complaints about the size of the octopus.

09:41.440 --> 09:43.380
And it's gooey on the inside,

09:43.380 --> 09:46.770
but piping hot, all the way through.

09:46.770 --> 09:47.560
Master...

09:47.560 --> 09:48.350
Yeah?

09:48.680 --> 09:50.520
You're doing fine work here.

09:50.520 --> 09:54.080
Three stars... No, I give you four stars!

09:54.080 --> 09:56.950
Yeah, whatever. Could you do that somewhere else?

09:57.410 --> 10:00.250
Little punk, forgetting he's here to work.

10:02.930 --> 10:03.900
What?

10:07.020 --> 10:08.100
Hey, stop! Watch it!

10:08.100 --> 10:09.500
That's dangerous!

10:20.010 --> 10:25.020
Interviews with Monster Girls

10:26.980 --> 10:29.810
So, why are you wearing that?

10:29.810 --> 10:34.700
I asked a staff member to let me wear it for an hour...

10:34.700 --> 10:38.340
Oh, so you like that kind of thing?

10:38.340 --> 10:39.210
I'm surprised—

10:39.210 --> 10:40.200
No, I don't!

10:40.200 --> 10:42.680
As a teacher... How to put it?

10:42.680 --> 10:46.770
I decided to participate as a sort of alternate or a backup.

10:46.770 --> 10:48.500
It's called "free participation."

10:48.500 --> 10:50.020
This way, even in a crowd,

10:50.020 --> 10:52.660
my aphrodisiac effect won't influence anyone!

10:51.410 --> 10:53.660
O-Okay... I get it.

10:53.660 --> 10:55.850
Could you not get so close, please?

10:55.850 --> 10:58.720
You went to these lengths to help the patrol?

10:58.720 --> 11:02.850
You really have a strong sense of duty, huh?

11:02.850 --> 11:05.850
Oh, no! I wouldn't say that!

11:05.850 --> 11:07.490
Ah, I'm sorry!

11:07.490 --> 11:10.050
It's about time to return the suit...

11:10.050 --> 11:11.420
Thanks for your trouble.

11:11.420 --> 11:13.230
Oh, not at all.

11:13.230 --> 11:15.790
Guess I'll take a little break, too.

11:15.790 --> 11:18.750
I think a smoking area was behind the main shrine.

11:18.750 --> 11:19.660
Care to join me?

11:20.150 --> 11:22.760
I'm off-duty soon, so I'll make another round first,

11:22.760 --> 11:25.410
before the next teacher starts.

11:25.410 --> 11:26.370
I'll go with you!

11:26.680 --> 11:27.430
Huh?

11:28.020 --> 11:30.660
Ah, um, I meant since you were going,

11:30.660 --> 11:34.830
I could patrol with you, on my way to return this...

11:34.830 --> 11:38.050
Okay, then let's go together.

11:38.050 --> 11:39.520
Yes!

11:39.520 --> 11:41.570
All right, see you later.

11:42.670 --> 11:46.680
<i>Wearing this suit, I needn't worry about my aphrodisiac effect.</i>

11:46.680 --> 11:47.850
<i>This is my chance!</i>

11:48.320 --> 11:49.980
O-Oh...

11:49.980 --> 11:52.080
Oh, no!

11:52.080 --> 11:52.560
Grab.

11:53.790 --> 11:55.150
I'm sorry!

11:55.150 --> 11:58.530
I can barely see with this on, so can I borrow your hand?

11:58.530 --> 11:59.650
Oh... Sure.

12:10.450 --> 12:12.370
Think you can find him that way?

12:12.370 --> 12:14.620
I'm concentrating now!

12:15.220 --> 12:16.000
See him?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.900
I guess not.

12:19.900 --> 12:22.620
He's holding hands with a teddy bear.

12:22.620 --> 12:23.480
<i>Wait!</i>

12:23.480 --> 12:25.930
<i>At this rate, no matter how daring I am,</i>

12:25.930 --> 12:30.030
<i>it just looks like Mr. Takahashi is horsing around with a mascot!</i>

12:28.440 --> 12:30.430
Stop, you...

12:32.470 --> 12:33.890
Ms. Satou?

12:33.890 --> 12:36.230
Wow, what a coincidence!

12:36.600 --> 12:38.990
So, where do you wanna go next?

12:38.990 --> 12:40.540
What should we do?

12:40.540 --> 12:43.470
Well, we have to hang out, at least a bit.

12:43.470 --> 12:45.400
After all, they bought us this.

12:45.400 --> 12:47.310
Yeah, just one cotton candy.

12:47.310 --> 12:48.970
Not that we asked for it.

12:48.970 --> 12:49.990
Oh, I know!

12:53.430 --> 12:55.730
That's actually never happened to me.

12:55.730 --> 12:57.760
You're definitely a snow woman.

12:57.760 --> 13:01.670
Lucky! I wish I could be a snow woman!

13:01.670 --> 13:03.540
What should we do next?

13:03.540 --> 13:06.060
There's still some time before the fireworks.

13:06.060 --> 13:07.490
There will be fireworks?

13:07.490 --> 13:09.200
They're launched from the ocean,

13:09.200 --> 13:11.510
but from here, you can see them well.

13:11.510 --> 13:12.820
Wow.

13:12.820 --> 13:13.790
I know!

13:14.140 --> 13:17.220
You know that little hill, behind the main shrine?

13:17.220 --> 13:20.810
Behind it is a small shrine

13:21.230 --> 13:23.820
where things are said to appear...

13:23.820 --> 13:26.020
Things? You mean ghosts?

13:26.020 --> 13:29.620
Wanna kill time and go check it out before the fireworks?

13:29.620 --> 13:31.520
That sounds kinda fun!

13:31.520 --> 13:32.310
Yeah.

13:32.310 --> 13:33.870
Isn't horror fun,

13:33.870 --> 13:36.870
the way it sends chills down your spine?

13:36.870 --> 13:39.880
So even snow women get chills from stuff like that?

13:39.880 --> 13:41.010
All right!

13:41.010 --> 13:45.860
Then, time to take off, on a demi ghost expedition!

13:45.860 --> 13:47.730
Yeah!

13:49.600 --> 13:53.220
No aphrodisiac effect, even when you held her hand, huh?

13:54.090 --> 13:59.060
Visualizing how she'd look in that kind of outfit,

13:59.060 --> 14:02.680
I'd say she's unconsciously blocking her true nature...

14:03.350 --> 14:06.990
Visualizing, huh? That's very profound.

14:06.990 --> 14:09.570
Well, even without something like that,

14:09.570 --> 14:12.290
if she can fully control her nature,

14:12.290 --> 14:15.960
even a succubus can have a normal...

14:16.330 --> 14:17.430
A normal what?

14:18.080 --> 14:20.960
Oh, just thinking out loud.

14:21.270 --> 14:24.370
Anyway, I should go grab

14:24.370 --> 14:27.930
the little takoyaki-loving monster who's forgotten his job!

14:27.930 --> 14:29.340
Keep up the good work.

14:31.410 --> 14:33.670
Come on! It's over there!

14:33.670 --> 14:35.380
A test of courage?

14:35.380 --> 14:36.020
Yeah.

14:36.020 --> 14:39.310
Today, I saw this TV show called <i>The Ghost Expedition</i>.

14:39.650 --> 14:41.650
And they say stuff like that

14:41.650 --> 14:44.220
happens at this small shrine, too...

14:44.220 --> 14:46.610
Well, it does have the atmosphere.

14:46.970 --> 14:49.210
We'll just take a look and come right back.

14:49.210 --> 14:50.420
So stupid.

14:50.420 --> 14:52.050
Huh? You scared?

14:52.050 --> 14:53.740
D-D-Don't be stupid!

14:53.740 --> 14:55.810
I'm just saying it's unscientific!

14:55.810 --> 14:58.130
There's no such thing as a ghost!

14:58.130 --> 15:00.260
But your sister is a vampire.

15:01.170 --> 15:02.700
Don't worry.

15:02.700 --> 15:06.240
No matter what we face, I'll protect you.

15:06.240 --> 15:09.970
If you're scared, just stay behind me!

15:09.970 --> 15:12.410
If you get scared, you can grab my arm.

15:10.430 --> 15:12.410
They already left.

15:12.410 --> 15:13.220
I'm not scared!

15:12.410 --> 15:13.260
Huh?

15:15.430 --> 15:20.560
I'm glad I brought this yukata, in case I got a chance to give him a glimpse.

15:21.250 --> 15:24.230
This is behind the shrine grounds, right?

15:28.100 --> 15:30.860
Ms. Satou's late.

15:29.290 --> 15:30.860
Excuse me...

15:30.860 --> 15:33.270
Well, it's a big crowd.

15:32.010 --> 15:33.270
Excuse me.

15:33.270 --> 15:34.220
Maybe she took a long way.

15:34.220 --> 15:35.270
Excuse me!

15:40.210 --> 15:44.290
The small shrine from the rumors is at the end of this path...

15:45.410 --> 15:48.270
What rumors? Don't be dumb!

15:48.270 --> 15:50.180
You're an open book.

15:50.820 --> 15:52.400
It sure is dark.

15:52.400 --> 15:53.590
Yeah.

15:53.590 --> 15:55.760
Are you doing okay, Hikari?

15:55.760 --> 15:59.530
The dark is no problem, but this kind of atmosphere does

15:59.530 --> 16:02.350
give me the chills!

16:02.760 --> 16:05.650
Hey, shouldn't we see the shrine soon?

16:05.650 --> 16:06.980
Y-Yeah.

16:07.970 --> 16:10.540
I knew I shouldn't have come...

16:10.540 --> 16:12.450
Maybe I can still go ba—

16:21.000 --> 16:22.610
Did you just hear a voice?

16:22.610 --> 16:23.410
Huh?

16:23.410 --> 16:24.960
Like a scream.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.140
Really?

16:26.140 --> 16:27.340
Hey, let's go back.

16:27.650 --> 16:30.450
Yeah, I'm sure of it. It's that way!

16:30.450 --> 16:32.090
Wait, Hikari!

16:34.500 --> 16:37.300
Ow... Huh?

16:39.840 --> 16:42.650
They left me... behind?

16:48.580 --> 16:49.570
No way.

16:50.110 --> 16:52.900
Surely, it can't be this way.

16:53.490 --> 16:54.820
Excuse me.

16:54.820 --> 16:57.070
Oh, not at all! I'm sorry!

16:57.390 --> 16:59.980
Huh? I'm sure I just...

17:01.260 --> 17:02.200
Yuki?

17:02.950 --> 17:04.750
Sorry to keep you waiting!

17:04.750 --> 17:05.510
Sa—

17:05.510 --> 17:06.950
Ms. Satou...

17:07.290 --> 17:08.180
Mr. Takahashi...

17:08.180 --> 17:09.460
Yes? What is it?

17:09.780 --> 17:11.470
Wasn't there just...

17:11.470 --> 17:12.500
Huh?

17:16.190 --> 17:18.140
Nah, there's nothing here!

17:18.570 --> 17:20.690
You were probably just seeing things.

17:20.690 --> 17:22.850
But I'm sure it was...

17:22.850 --> 17:25.460
Just relax... I'll—

17:27.100 --> 17:28.000
What's with you?

17:28.000 --> 17:30.200
J-J-Ju... Just now, I saw a spirit!

17:30.200 --> 17:31.860
What, you too? Cut it out.

17:31.860 --> 17:34.700
It's true! I really saw one!

17:34.700 --> 17:37.190
Hey, does it feel kind of cold?

17:37.190 --> 17:38.870
You're right. It does.

17:41.940 --> 17:45.040
D-Do you hear a voice from over there?

17:45.040 --> 17:47.700
Yeah, I do hear murmurs...

17:47.700 --> 17:49.960
Sounds like it's from the other path—

17:49.960 --> 17:51.800
Hey! Cut it out!

18:03.710 --> 18:05.920
Sorry, Yuki. Are you okay?

18:05.920 --> 18:08.950
How could you leave me behind?

18:09.930 --> 18:12.050
Someone shone a light at me!

18:12.050 --> 18:14.190
My eyes... My eyes!

18:14.790 --> 18:17.960
Looks like someone's on the other path, too.

18:17.960 --> 18:20.450
Hey, why don't we just go back?

18:20.450 --> 18:21.770
Yeah...

18:21.770 --> 18:24.250
The voice wasn't a ghost or anything.

18:24.250 --> 18:28.410
Of course spirits and ghosts don't exist, right?

18:28.410 --> 18:32.960
But there's a super cute vampire, dullahan, and snow woman here!

18:43.310 --> 18:44.260
Hey!

18:45.730 --> 18:46.600
Huh?

18:49.200 --> 18:50.460
Ms. Satou said

18:50.460 --> 18:53.900
she heard kids' voices from the hills here, so we came to look.

18:54.360 --> 18:56.350
So it was you girls?

18:56.350 --> 18:59.720
You know you shouldn't go into dark places like that.

19:01.060 --> 19:02.420
We shouldn't have.

19:02.420 --> 19:03.830
We're very sorry.

19:03.830 --> 19:05.700
If anything had happened...

19:34.860 --> 19:36.360
What was that?! What was that?!

19:36.360 --> 19:38.680
Wow! They're that big?

19:38.680 --> 19:40.450
It's my first time seeing them, too!

19:40.450 --> 19:43.060
This place is great for watching fireworks!

19:43.060 --> 19:44.690
It's a secret hot spot.

19:44.690 --> 19:46.890
Yeah, it feels like we lucked out.

19:47.470 --> 19:50.350
Fireworks!

19:54.680 --> 19:57.470
Fireworks really are nice, huh?

19:57.470 --> 19:59.090
They sure are.

19:58.230 --> 20:01.820
Fireworks! Fireworks! Fireworks!

20:01.820 --> 20:03.310
What's wrong, Mr. T?

20:07.460 --> 20:10.930
Summer really is great...

20:12.900 --> 20:13.690
Yeah!

20:38.960 --> 20:41.840
The events of a mysterious world,

20:41.840 --> 20:45.680
Like the ones you hear of in fairy tales,

20:45.890 --> 20:48.720
Are actually closer than you think

20:48.720 --> 20:52.810
Just like the way you and I met!

20:52.810 --> 20:55.690
When I stood up tall to gaze at

20:55.690 --> 20:59.780
The familiar scenery outside my window,

20:59.780 --> 21:06.370
Even days that felt like torture seemed precious somehow.

21:06.370 --> 21:13.620
Stuck in my heart, I can't put them into words

21:13.620 --> 21:20.710
How should I try to put these feelings into words?

21:21.510 --> 21:24.840
Laughing over stupid things...

21:24.840 --> 21:28.310
Getting mad over small details...

21:28.310 --> 21:35.270
We'll keep carving these trivial moments into our hearts.

21:35.270 --> 21:38.360
Sometimes I'm feeling sad...

21:38.360 --> 21:42.190
But when I'm with you, I'm so happy!

21:42.190 --> 21:46.200
We'll keep on building these irreplaceable moments,

21:46.200 --> 21:52.960
And little by little, we'll come to understand one another.

21:54.410 --> 21:54.460
Biology Prep Room

21:56.290 --> 21:58.420
Did you have fun at the festival?

21:58.730 --> 22:00.920
Yeah! I even got to see you!

22:01.430 --> 22:02.930
This really is amazing...

22:02.930 --> 22:05.590
I can sense you, but I can't see a trace of you.

22:05.940 --> 22:07.220
Wait, are you naked?

22:07.220 --> 22:09.970
Yeah, it seemed suited to someone like me.

22:10.500 --> 22:13.330
I'm happy you feel that way, but...

22:13.330 --> 22:14.680
Aren't you embarrassed?

22:14.680 --> 22:17.540
Huh? No one can see me, so not really.

22:18.260 --> 22:19.770
I guess that makes sense.

22:20.300 --> 22:24.450
But I know some invisible people who say it embarrasses them!

22:24.450 --> 22:25.140
Oh?

22:25.140 --> 22:29.240
They say even being naked in front of someone is embarrassing.

22:32.350 --> 22:35.500
Sorry, but could you put something on, after all?

22:35.500 --> 22:37.160
I don't know where I should look.

22:37.160 --> 22:38.150
Okay...

22:38.150 --> 22:41.700
Anyway, are you familiar with your face and appearance?

22:41.700 --> 22:44.500
Yes! I've had my portrait drawn, too!

22:44.500 --> 22:47.610
These days, I can even get 3-D captures!

22:47.610 --> 22:48.840
Oh, by "portrait," I mean—

22:48.840 --> 22:49.940
Like this?

22:49.940 --> 22:51.760
Th-That's right.

22:51.760 --> 22:53.970
People touch me and make their drawings from that.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.870
Would you mind showing me your face?

22:56.870 --> 22:59.600
Sh-Should I show you one of my pictures?

22:59.600 --> 23:04.030
No, I'll never get this chance again, so I want to find out for myself.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.440
Um...

23:06.620 --> 23:09.290
Your eyes are on the large side, right?

23:09.290 --> 23:11.460
And your nose has a prominent bridge.

23:11.460 --> 23:13.320
U-Um...

23:13.320 --> 23:15.450
And your eyebrows are thick.

23:15.450 --> 23:17.160
It's kind of like you just woke up.

23:17.530 --> 23:19.430
I see... Uh-huh.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.850
Something like this, I bet.

23:26.860 --> 23:27.760
You jerk!

23:27.760 --> 23:29.970
You molester teacher!

23:30.830 --> 23:32.220
Huh?

23:32.220 --> 23:34.970
Yet being naked doesn't embarrass her?
